<rml>
<head>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="theme.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="editmap_info.rcss"/>
</head>
<body>
    <!-- editmap (dev map editor, game::look_debug) info panel. A passive doc over
         the map, replacing the curses w_info box. The #editmap-info element is
         filled each redraw by editmap::update_view_with_help via info_panel_text()
         (tile coords / terrain / furniture / cache / light / fields / trap /
         creature / vehicle / items / graffiti + the editing-mode help footer).
         Anchored bottom-left so the placement cursor on the map stays visible.
         The editing menus are uilists (already RmlUi); the map cursor/selection
         render on the GPU map path. Dev/wizard tool. -->
    <div class="panel emi-panel">
        <div id="editmap-info" class="emi-text"></div>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
